# Weights we made that are under test, never in the donation path (doc/plans/base-model-candidates.md,
# the before/after test; ADR-0004 as amended 2026-10-22, decision 5). Same format and rules as
# models.manifest — this line IS the licence record, and explore.py refuses a LoRA with no line in
# either file — but kept apart so no ComfyUI start depends on an experiment or on the R2 keys. The
# home store gets these with one host-side command, the R2 env from `pass show` in that command
# only (doc/infra.md, Home GPU). The one chosen moves to models.manifest by its own ADR-0004
# amendment; the rest are dropped from here.
#
